  {
    "annotations": {
      "destructiveHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": false,
      "readOnlyHint": false,
    },
    "description": "Deletes a Tile and everything below it, for good: no tool brings it back. References to any of them stay, broken. Answers null. Refused with TileNotFound: no Tile of that id in the System, deleted or never there; map or open_tile to find the right one. RootFixed: the Root is the user; it is never moved, swapped nor deleted. HelpReadOnly: that Tile is Help's, which every user reads and none writes; change a Tile of the user's System instead.",
