    "description": "Empties a Context slot holding a Reference. The Tile it pointed at is untouched; a slot holding a Tile, or nothing, is left as it is. Answers null. Refused with TileNotFound: no Tile of that id in the System, deleted or never there; map or open_tile to find the right one. HelpReadOnly: that Tile is Help's, which every user reads and none writes; change a Tile of the user's System instead.",
